The evaluation will be performed visually on the selected spots.

A scale in 5 points will be used (0 to 4):

0=no hypopigmented lesion;

1. very slight area of hypopigmentation of very small size and very slightly fairer than the surrounding skin;
2. slight area of hypopigmentation of small size and slightly fairer than the surrounding skin;
3. moderate : area of hypopigmentation of moderate size and much fairer than the surrounding skin;
