Inclusion Criteria:

1. Female, aged 18 to 65 years;
2. Clinically diagnosed with possible non-lactational (more than 6 months since stopping breastfeeding) granulomatous lobular mastitis or periductal mastitis.
3. Mscore ≤ 4 points;
